  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HELP for war refugees from Ukraine in Poland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Another month has passed since Russia started the war in Ukraine. Over 3.5 million people from Ukraine found refuge in Poland. The first wave of aid is over, but help is still needed. We need your help to keep going with our activities for refugees. We are asking you for the long-term HELP, especially for REGULAR (MONTHLY) DONATIONS, which are crucial to us!</narrative>
  </description>
